Tier 2 source-derived Rust ports (modified language, storage, validation and APIs):
inpaint.rs: modules/photo/src/inpaint.cpp (single-channel NS fast marching).
segmentation.rs: modules/imgproc/src/distransform.cpp (chamfer conventions),
  connectedcomponents.cpp (default ordering/statistics); label/fill traversals
  are independently implemented. The numerical distance oracle is the CPU/IPP
  path; no Intel IPP code or binary is included.
contours.rs: modules/imgproc/src/contours_new.cpp, contours_common.hpp/.cpp;
  modules/geometry/src/convhull.cpp and geometry.cpp (contour measurement only).
drawing.rs: modules/imgproc/src/drawing.cpp (LINE_8 clipping and polygon fill).
misc.rs: modules/geometry/src/moments.cpp (raster moments and completion);
  modules/imgproc/src/templmatch.cpp, bilateral_filter.dispatch.cpp,
  bilateral_filter.simd.hpp, deriv.cpp (Laplacian default stencil).
lines.rs: modules/imgproc/src/lsd.cpp, hough.cpp, smooth.dispatch.cpp,
  fixedpoint.inl.hpp, resize.cpp, and modules/core/src/mathfuncs_core.simd.hpp.
All paths above are pinned to https://github.com/opencv/opencv/tree/5.0.0/ .

